<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: boring festive feast -->
  <VCE_BoringFeast.stages.boring_festive_feast.label>banquete natalino entediante</VCE_BoringFeast.stages.boring_festive_feast.label>

  <!-- EN: We just went throught he motions, without putting much heart into it. The food was a bit bland. -->
  <VCE_BoringFeast.stages.boring_festive_feast.description>Só cumprimos as formalidades, sem muito entusiasmo. A comida estava um pouco sem graça.</VCE_BoringFeast.stages.boring_festive_feast.description>

  <!-- EN: fun festive feast -->
  <VCE_FunFeast.stages.fun_festive_feast.label>banquete natalino divertido</VCE_FunFeast.stages.fun_festive_feast.label>

  <!-- EN: Gathering together to share a festive feast really enhances the spirit of the season. -->
  <VCE_FunFeast.stages.fun_festive_feast.description>Reunir todo mundo para compartilhar um banquete natalino realmente fortalece o espírito desta época.</VCE_FunFeast.stages.fun_festive_feast.description>

  <!-- EN: terrible festive feast -->
  <VCE_TerribleFeast.stages.terrible_festive_feast.label>banquete natalino terrível</VCE_TerribleFeast.stages.terrible_festive_feast.label>

  <!-- EN: The food was disgusting and we just quarreled and bickered through all of it. -->
  <VCE_TerribleFeast.stages.terrible_festive_feast.description>A comida estava nojenta, e passamos o tempo todo discutindo e brigando.</VCE_TerribleFeast.stages.terrible_festive_feast.description>

  <!-- EN: unforgettable festive feast -->
  <VCE_UnforgettableFeast.stages.unforgettable_festive_feast.label>banquete natalino inesquecível</VCE_UnforgettableFeast.stages.unforgettable_festive_feast.label>

  <!-- EN: We truly felt like a big family and the food was just simply amazing! -->
  <VCE_UnforgettableFeast.stages.unforgettable_festive_feast.description>Realmente nos sentimos como uma grande família, e a comida estava simplesmente maravilhosa!</VCE_UnforgettableFeast.stages.unforgettable_festive_feast.description>

  <!-- EN: consumed eggnog -->
  <VCE_ConsumedEggnog.stages.consumed_eggnog.label>consumiu gemada</VCE_ConsumedEggnog.stages.consumed_eggnog.label>

  <!-- EN: I can feel the festive spirit. Eggnog tastes so good. -->
  <VCE_ConsumedEggnog.stages.consumed_eggnog.description>Consigo sentir o espírito natalino. Gemada é uma delícia.</VCE_ConsumedEggnog.stages.consumed_eggnog.description>

  <!-- EN: consumed festive cracker -->
  <VCE_ConsumedFestiveCracker.stages.consumed_festive_cracker.label>abriu estalinho natalino</VCE_ConsumedFestiveCracker.stages.consumed_festive_cracker.label>

  <!-- EN: It felt so great to crack open the festive cracker. -->
  <VCE_ConsumedFestiveCracker.stages.consumed_festive_cracker.description>Foi tão bom abrir o estalinho natalino.</VCE_ConsumedFestiveCracker.stages.consumed_festive_cracker.description>

  <!-- EN: milk and cookies! -->
  <VCE_ConsumedMilkAndCookies.stages.milk_and_cookies.label>leite com biscoitos!</VCE_ConsumedMilkAndCookies.stages.milk_and_cookies.label>

  <!-- EN: These cookies and milk are divine! -->
  <VCE_ConsumedMilkAndCookies.stages.milk_and_cookies.description>Esses biscoitos com leite são divinos!</VCE_ConsumedMilkAndCookies.stages.milk_and_cookies.description>

  <!-- EN: jolly songs -->
  <VCE_Thought_FestiveJukebox.stages.jolly_songs.label>canções alegres</VCE_Thought_FestiveJukebox.stages.jolly_songs.label>

  <!-- EN: I’m listening to some festive hits! -->
  <VCE_Thought_FestiveJukebox.stages.jolly_songs.description>Estou ouvindo alguns sucessos natalinos!</VCE_Thought_FestiveJukebox.stages.jolly_songs.description>

  <!-- EN: boring festive singing -->
  <VCE_BoringCarols.stages.boring_festive_singing.label>cânticos natalinos entediantes</VCE_BoringCarols.stages.boring_festive_singing.label>

  <!-- EN: The leader treated us like children, wanting so desperately to hear something to lift their spirits. -->
  <VCE_BoringCarols.stages.boring_festive_singing.description>A liderança nos tratou como crianças, desesperada para ouvir algo que levantasse o próprio ânimo.</VCE_BoringCarols.stages.boring_festive_singing.description>

  <!-- EN: fun festive singing -->
  <VCE_FunCarols.stages.fun_festive_singing.label>cânticos natalinos divertidos</VCE_FunCarols.stages.fun_festive_singing.label>

  <!-- EN: The leader lifted our spirits and made us feel a festive spirit that will only make us stronger. -->
  <VCE_FunCarols.stages.fun_festive_singing.description>A liderança levantou nosso ânimo e nos fez sentir um espírito natalino que só nos tornará mais fortes.</VCE_FunCarols.stages.fun_festive_singing.description>

  <!-- EN: terrible festive singing -->
  <VCE_TerribleCarols.stages.terrible_festive_singing.label>cânticos natalinos terríveis</VCE_TerribleCarols.stages.terrible_festive_singing.label>

  <!-- EN: The leader displayed a lack of passion and the festive feeling just wasn't there. -->
  <VCE_TerribleCarols.stages.terrible_festive_singing.description>Faltou entusiasmo à liderança, e o clima natalino simplesmente não apareceu.</VCE_TerribleCarols.stages.terrible_festive_singing.description>

  <!-- EN: unforgettable festive singing -->
  <VCE_UnforgettableCarols.stages.unforgettable_festive_singing.label>cânticos natalinos inesquecíveis</VCE_UnforgettableCarols.stages.unforgettable_festive_singing.label>

  <!-- EN: We can still hear the mesmerizing words of the carols, as they reminded us of the importance of our shared beliefs. We can just feel our sadness vanish away. -->
  <VCE_UnforgettableCarols.stages.unforgettable_festive_singing.description>Ainda ouvimos as palavras cativantes das canções, que nos lembraram da importância de nossas crenças compartilhadas. Dá para sentir a tristeza indo embora.</VCE_UnforgettableCarols.stages.unforgettable_festive_singing.description>

  <!-- EN: awful toy -->
