  <!-- EN: This toy is awesome! It’s really fun to play with! -->
  <VCE_Thought_Toy_Children.stages.good_toy.description>Esse brinquedo é demais! É muito divertido brincar com ele!</VCE_Thought_Toy_Children.stages.good_toy.description>

